  "label": "User projected onto the textual material describing Morgan Freeman's role",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'morgan freeman played god in bruce almighty' which explicitly states the actor's role in the film. This projection is implicit, as the meme invites the user to recognize and internalize the humorous or ironic reference to Freeman's portrayal of God, thereby aligning the user's perspective with the meme's framing of the actor's role. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the projection occurs through the user's engagement with the text and its association with the visual material.",
